abstract: >-
  GRUS-STD-60084 v2.0-U-SI is the metric edition of the
  GRUS-STD-60084 measurement standard for large computational
  loads: a two-axis facility classification (workload shape
  W-1/W-2/W-3; cooling type C-1 through C-5), boundary water
  quantities derived from first principles in SI units, five
  evidence grades, and a ten-step reproducible measurement
  protocol. Published free for adoption by any jurisdiction;
  law-dependent values are fill-in jurisdictional entries
  completed by the adopting authority. Version of record of the
  standard: GRUS-STD-60084 v2.0-U (Uniform Edition),
  doi:10.5281/zenodo.23246001.
